+<li><a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-58643">FHIR-58643</a> - Removed <code>isRecordOfRequest</code> (R5 <code>reported</code>). A MedicationRequest serves as an authorization, which is not necessarily actionable unless it has the 'actionable' tag or is used with a Task or in specific workflows (see Scope and Usage). This also resolves <a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-53305">FHIR-53305</a>, <a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-54446">FHIR-54446</a>, <a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-58459">FHIR-58459</a>, <a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-55006">FHIR-55006</a>, and makes <a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-49863">FHIR-49863</a> and <a href="https://jira.hl7.org/browse/FHIR-55005">FHIR-55005</a> moot.</li>
